<view class="admin-page admin-secondary-page admin-order-detail-page">
  <view class="admin-header">
    <view class="admin-title">{{ title }}</view>
    <view class="admin-subtitle">
      查看订单快照、派单记录与人工状态调整；订单状态以后端校验和服务调用结果为准。
    </view>
  </view>

  <loading-view wx:if="{{ loading }}" text="正在加载订单"></loading-view>

  <view wx:elif="{{ errorText }}" class="admin-section-card admin-error-card">
    {{ errorText }}
  </view>

  <block wx:elif="{{ order._id }}">
    <view class="admin-section-card admin-status-card">
      <view class="admin-section-head">
        <view>
          <view class="admin-section-title">状态信息</view>
          <view class="admin-section-note">{{ order.orderNo }}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="admin-status-pill {{ order.statusTone }}">
          {{ order.statusText }}
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="admin-status-grid">
        <view class="admin-status-item">
          <view class="admin-status-label">支付状态</view>
          <view class="admin-status-value">{{ order.payStatusText }}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="admin-status-item">
          <view class="admin-status-label">退款状态</view>
          <view class="admin-status-value">{{ order.refundStatusText }}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="admin-status-item">
          <view class="admin-status-label">预约时间</view>
          <view class="admin-status-value">{{ order.appointmentText }}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="admin-status-item">
          <view class="admin-status-label">订单金额</view>
          <view class="admin-status-value admin-amount">{{ order.priceText }}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="admin-section-card admin-info-card">
      <view class="admin-section-title">基础信息</view>
      <view class="admin-detail-row">
        <text class="admin-detail-label">服务名称</text>
        <text class="admin-detail-value">{{ order.serviceName }}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="admin-detail-row">
        <text class="admin-detail-label">订单号</text>
        <text class="admin-detail-value">{{ order.orderNo }}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="admin-detail-row admin-detail-row--stack">
        <text class="admin-detail-label">服务地址</text>
        <text class="admin-detail-value">{{ order.addressText }}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="admin-section-card admin-info-card">
      <view class="admin-section-title">用户或服务方信息</view>
      <view class="admin-detail-row">
        <text class="admin-detail-label">用户联系</text>
        <text class="admin-detail-value">{{ order.contactText }}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="admin-detail-row">
        <text class="admin-detail-label">服务方</text>
        <text class="admin-detail-value">{{ order.workerText }}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="admin-detail-row admin-detail-row--stack">
        <text class="admin-detail-label">完工说明</text>
        <text class="admin-detail-value">{{ order.finishRemarkText }}</text>
      </view>
      <view
        wx:if="{{ order.finish_images && order.finish_images.length }}"
        class="admin-image-grid"
      >
        <image
          wx:for="{{ order.finish_images }}"
          wx:key="*this"
          class="admin-finish-image"
          src="{{ item }}"
          mode="aspectFill"
        ></image>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="admin-section-card admin-log-card">
      <view class="admin-section-title">操作记录</view>
      <view class="admin-section-note">
        派单日志、订单状态日志和资金相关结果由后端记录，页面仅提供查看入口。
      </view>
      <button class="admin-outline-button admin-wide-button" bindtap="goDispatchLogs">
        查看派单日志
      </button>
    </view>

    <view class="admin-section-card admin-action-card">
      <view class="admin-section-title">管理操作</view>
      <view class="admin-section-note">
        指派、回流和状态调整均通过既有 service 调用提交，前端不直接完成订单或结算收益。
      </view>
      <view class="admin-action-row">
        <button
          wx:if="{{ order.canAssign }}"
          class="admin-action-button"
          bindtap="goAssignWorker"
        >
          指派师傅
        </button>
        <button
          wx:if="{{ order.canUnassign }}"
          class="admin-outline-button"
          loading="{{ submitting }}"
          disabled="{{ submitting }}"
          bindtap="unassignOrder"
        >
          取消指派并回流
        </button>
      </view>
      <view class="admin-form-item">
        <view class="admin-form-label">人工状态调整</view>
        <picker
          mode="selector"
          range="{{ statusLabels }}"
          value="{{ selectedStatusIndex }}"
          bindchange="onStatusChange"
        >
          <view class="admin-picker-value">{{ selectedStatusText }}</view>
        </picker>
      </view>
      <button
        class="admin-action-button admin-wide-button"
        loading="{{ submitting }}"
        disabled="{{ submitting }}"
        bindtap="submitStatus"
      >
        提交状态调整
      </button>
    </view>
  </block>

  <empty-state
    wx:else
    title="订单不存在"
    description="请返回订单列表重新查看"
  ></empty-state>
</view>
